00:20:48.320 --> 00:20:54.330
So superconducting refers to materials that,
that when they're cold they have basically

00:20:54.330 --> 00:20:56.460
no resistance.

00:20:56.460 --> 00:21:03.590
And by using the right kind of superconductors
