00:21:48.200 --> 00:21:52.660
And what's phenomenal about this this element
is that you can combine it with it with a

00:21:52.660 --> 00:21:59.160
standard capacitor and you can make it oscillate
in the microwave regimes, so around five gigahertz

00:21:59.160 --> 00:22:05.850
and choosing the right parameters of the capacitance
in the Josephson injunction you can isolate

00:22:05.850 --> 00:22:12.140
it to build a qubit state, so zero and one,
that that resonates at around five gigahertz.

00:22:12.140 --> 00:22:15.530
So in your case can you walk through an example.

