00:26:40.700 --> 00:26:42.310
by Josephson junction.

00:26:42.310 --> 00:26:48.191
And so super current going around forever
that way you call it zero and super current

00:26:48.191 --> 00:26:53.180
going around forever that way, counter-clockwise,
sorry, clockwise for you then you call it

00:26:53.180 --> 00:26:54.180
one.

00:26:54.180 --> 00:26:59.130
And then you know super current going around
